{"title":"Stonegaze Cultist","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 20 Human that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/stonegaze-cultist\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/stonegaze-cultist?lv=20\">Lv 20</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/stonegaze-cultist?lv=22\">Lv 22 <span>8</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/stonegaze-cultist?lv=23\">Lv 23 <span>4</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/stonegaze-cultist?lv=24\">Lv 24 <span>5</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/stonegaze-cultist?lv=25\">Lv 25 <span>4</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/stonegaze-cultist?lv=26\">Lv 26 <span>1</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/stonegaze-cultist?lv=20\" title=\"Pick level 20\"><td><b>20</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>66</td><td>15.5</td><td>1,000</td><td class=\"muted\">198 · 21.7 · 3,000</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/stonegaze-cultist?lv=22\" title=\"Pick level 22\"><td><b>22</b></td><td>74</td><td>16.6</td><td>1,100</t